        <p style="color:var(--text-muted);font-size:16px;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto">Get in touch and we'll handle everything. Your website is built, fully optimised, and ready to start working for your business.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="display:grid;gap:48px;max-width:900px;margin:0 auto">
        <div class="glass" style="padding:40px;border-radius:28px">
          <h3 style="font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;margin-bottom:24px">Contact Us to Get Started</h3>
          <form id="reclaim-form" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px">
            <input type="text" name="website" style="display:none!important;position:absolute!important;left:-9999px" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true" />
            <input type="hidden" name="business" value={businessName} />
            <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px">
              <div>
                <label style="display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text-muted);margin-bottom:6px">Name *</label>
                <input type="text" name="name" required style="width:100%;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);color:#fff;font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-size:15px;outline:none;transition:border-color 0.3s" onfocus="this.style.borderColor='#8B78E6'" onblur="this.style.borderColor='rgba(255,255,255,0.08)'" />
              </div>
              <div>
                <label style="display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text-muted);margin-bottom:6px">Email *</label>
                <input type="email" name="email" required style="width:100%;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);color:#fff;font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-size:15px;outline:none;transition:border-color 0.3s" onfocus="this.style.borderColor='#8B78E6'" onblur="this.style.borderColor='rgba(255,255,255,0.08)'" />
              </div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <label style="display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text-muted);margin-bottom:6px">Phone</label>
              <input type="tel" name="phone" style="width:100%;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);color:#fff;font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-size:15px;outline:none;transition:border-color 0.3s" onfocus="this.style.borderColor='#8B78E6'" onblur="this.style.borderColor='rgba(255,255,255,0.08)'" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <label style="display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text-muted);margin-bottom:6px">Message</label>
              <textarea name="message" rows="4" placeholder="Any questions or anything you'd like to discuss..." style="width:100%;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);color:#fff;font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-size:15px;outline:none;resize:vertical;transition:border-color 0.3s" onfocus="this.style.borderColor='#8B78E6'" onblur="this.style.borderColor='rgba(255,255,255,0.08)'"></textarea>
            </div>
            <button type="submit" id="reclaim-submit" class="btn-cta" style="align-self:flex-start">Send Request <svg width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6" /></svg></button>
          </form>
          <div id="reclaim-success" style="display:none;padding:24px;border-radius:16px;background:rgba(78,205,196,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(78,205,196,0.2);margin-top:20px">
            <p style="color:#4ECDC4;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 4px">Request sent!</p>
            <p style="color:var(--text-muted);font-size:14px;margin:0">We'll be in touch within 24 hours to discuss getting your website live.</p>
          </div>
          <div id="reclaim-error" style="display:none;padding:24px;border-radius:16px;background:rgba(239,68,68,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.2);margin-top:20px">
            <p style="color:#ef4444;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 4px">Something went wrong</p>
            <p id="reclaim-error-msg" style="color:var(--text-muted);font-size:14px;margin:0">Please try again or email us directly at <a href="mailto:barry@bytedigital.co.nz" style="color:var(--secondary)">barry@bytedigital.co.nz</a>.</p>
          </div>
          <script is:inline>
            (function() {
              var form = document.getElementById('reclaim-form');
              var btn = document.getElementById('reclaim-submit');
              var successEl = document.getElementById('reclaim-success');
              var errorEl = document.getElementById('reclaim-error');
              var errorMsg = document.getElementById('reclaim-error-msg');
              var originalBtnHTML = btn.innerHTML;

              form.addEventListener('submit', function(e) {
                e.preventDefault();
                var data = {};
                new FormData(form).forEach(function(v, k) { data[k] = v; });

                btn.disabled = true;
                btn.innerHTML = 'Sending...';
                btn.style.opacity = '0.7';
                successEl.style.display = 'none';
                errorEl.style.display = 'none';

                fetch(location.hostname === 'localhost' ? 'https://bytedigital.co.nz/api/contact' : '/api/contact', {
                  method: 'POST',
                  headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
                  body: JSON.stringify(data)
                })
                .then(function(res) { return res.json(); })
                .then(function(result) {
                  if (result.success) {
                    form.style.display = 'none';
                    successEl.style.display = 'block';
                  } else {
                    errorMsg.textContent = result.error || 'Please try again or email us directly at barry@bytedigital.co.nz.';
                    errorEl.style.display = 'block';
                    btn.disabled = false;
                    btn.innerHTML = originalBtnHTML;
                    btn.style.opacity = '1';
                  }
                })
                .catch(function() {
                  errorMsg.textContent = 'Network error. Please email us directly at barry@bytedigital.co.nz.';
                  errorEl.style.display = 'block';
                  btn.disabled = false;
                  btn.innerHTML = originalBtnHTML;
                  btn.style.opacity = '1';
                });
              });
            })();
          </script>
        </div>

        <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:32px">
          <div>
            <h4 style="font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;margin-bottom:8px">Email Us Directly</h4>
            <a href="mailto:barry@bytedigital.co.nz" style="color:var(--secondary);font-size:16px;font-weight:600">barry@bytedigital.co.nz</a>
            <p style="color:var(--text-muted);font-size:13px;margin:4px 0 0">Prefer email? Send us a message anytime.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 style="font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;margin-bottom:8px">View Your Website</h4>
            <a href="https://master.brooklyn-services.pages.dev/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--secondary);font-size:16px;font-weight:600">master.brooklyn-services.pages.dev <svg width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="vertical-align:middle;margin-left:4px"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"/></svg></a>
            <p style="color:var(--text-muted);font-size:13px;margin:4px 0 0">See the 23 pages already built and ready for you.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 style="font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;margin-bottom:8px">Contact Page</h4>
            <a href="/contact" style="color:var(--secondary);font-size:16px;font-weight:600">bytedigital.co.nz/contact</a>
            <p style="color:var(--text-muted);font-size:13px;margin:4px 0 0">Use our main contact form for detailed enquiries.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 style="font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;margin-bottom:8px">Location</h4>
            <p style="color:var(--text-muted);font-size:15px">Christchurch, Canterbury<br />New Zealand</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 style="font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;margin-bottom:8px">Response Time</h4>
            <p style="color:var(--text-muted);font-size:15px">We respond to all enquiries within 24 hours. Most same day.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ -->
  <section class="section reveal" style="background:var(--bg-dark);border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04)">
    <div class="container">
      <div style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:48px">
        <div class="section-label">FAQ</div>
        <h2 style="font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,40px);font-weight:700;color:#fff;margin-bottom:12px">Frequently Asked <span class="gradient-text">Questions</span></h2>
        <p style="color:var(--text-muted);font-size:16px;max-width:500px;margin:0 auto">Everything you need to know about your website and working with Byte Digital.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-list" style="max-width:700px">
        {faqItems.map((item, i) => (
          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-q" data-faq={i.toString()}>
              {item.question}
              <svg width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 4v16m8-8H4"/></svg>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-a" id={`faq-a-${i.toString()}`}>
              <p>{item.answer}</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Final CTA -->
  <section class="section cta-section reveal">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta-box">
        <div class="glow-orb mint" style="top:-50%;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);opacity:0.08"></div>
        <h2>Ready to Activate Your <span class="gradient-text">Digital Edge?</span></h2>
        <p>Every day your website isn't live is a day potential customers can't find you. 23 pages are already built, already optimised, and ready to start bringing Christchurch plumbing and drainage work to you.</p>
        <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;justify-content:center">
          <a href="/contact" class="btn-cta" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;text-decoration:none">
            Contact Byte Digital
            <svg width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6" /></svg>
          </a>
          <a href="https://master.brooklyn-services.pages.dev/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;text-decoration:none;padding:14px 28px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);color:#fff;font-weight:600;font-size:15px;font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;transition:all 0.3s">
            View Your Website
            <svg width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<script>
document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
  document.querySelectorAll('.faq-q').forEach(btn => {
    btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const idx = btn.getAttribute('data-faq');
      const answer = document.getElementById(`faq-a-${idx}`);
      const isOpen = btn.classList.toggle('open');
      if (answer) answer.classList.toggle('open');
    });
  });
});
</script>
